<title>EL SALVADOR: Salvador inflation rose 7.4 pct in 1996 - cenbank.</title>
<headline>Salvador inflation rose 7.4 pct in 1996 - cenbank.</headline>
<dateline>SAN SALVADOR 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salvadoran inflation rose 7.4 percent in 1996, slowing from 11.4 percent the year before, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In December, the consumer price index rose 0.3 percentage points, compared with a drop of 0.6 percent in November, it said.</p>
<p>((-- Alberto Barrera, San Salvador bureau 503 223-4746))</p>
</text>
